{
   cranelift-jit code memory is released with free_memory, which valgrind cannot see as a free
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: reachable,possible
   ...
   fun:*cranelift_jit*
}
{
   Rust std thread-local destructors and lazy statics stay reachable
   Memcheck:Leak
   match-leak-kinds: reachable
   ...
   fun:*std*thread*
}
{
   The collector scans stacks conservatively: dead slots hold uninitialised words
   Memcheck:Cond
   ...
   fun:*rscl_runtime*gc*
}
{
   The collector scans stacks conservatively (values derived from scanned words)
   Memcheck:Value8
   ...
   fun:*rscl_runtime*gc*
}
{
   The collector reads through object slots found by the conservative scan
   Memcheck:Cond
   ...
   fun:*rscl_runtime*arena*
}
{
   The collector reads through object slots found by the conservative scan
   Memcheck:Value8
   ...
   fun:*rscl_runtime*arena*
}
{
   The dead part of the stack (below the stack pointer) is zeroed on purpose
   Memcheck:Addr8
   ...
   fun:*rscl_runtime*gc*clear_dead_stack*
}
